t.\n4. Declare no_model_load, MODEL_SPECS=[] and zero current model calls. Identify cached verifier work or artifact aggregation as the inference_substrate. Training small numeric heads is not an LLM load.\n5. Read ops/arc_solve_registry.yaml before any solve claim. This task makes zero game calls and zero model calls. It studies cross-game generalization through existing trajectory_supervisor outcomes; no public-game re-solve, hand adapter or outer-loop reverse engineering.\n6. Reproduce Exp8342 strict_mypy errors: arc_supervisor_frontier_8342.py indirectly accesses native through arc_supervisor_frontier_8328. Import the defining module explicitly or expose an intentional typed export. Preserve the same runtime behavior and every reader assertion. Do not use type:ignore, weaken strict mypy or add a new executor. Qualify the existing failure branches under frozen authority.\n7. Authenticate the last qualified frontier from Exp8314 directly; Exp8328/8342 remain failed evidence. Inspect only new authenticated live_agent_self_discovery supervisor receipts. Preserve game/run/PID hashes, resolved_by_levelup, actions_to_levelup, fired/helped counts and stagnations_unredirected.\n8. If no new firings exist, emit complete_null_no_supervisor_outcomes once. Do not change the arm table. A comparison needs at least3 overlapping games and5 firings in each of2 shared arm cells. Keep all per_game_results; missing propensities makes analysis descriptive. Recommend selection only within the curated arms, never model-generated new arms.\n9. Run private E2E-017/018 and a fresh-process replay of the new candidate before publication. Diagnose the Exp8342 replay failure separately without rewriting its primary. Set arc_reader_ready_score on qualified readers; arc_outcome_support_score requires actual new support. Write docs/research-notes/v720-arc-outcomes.md.\n10. Run relevant unit and consumer tests, scoped Ruff check/format, strict mypy and scripts/check_spec_coverage.py --files <owne